        "Retain runtime-contract checks and omit MsgPack011, MsgPack016, and MsgPack017, as implemented and documented.",
        "Run the same complete diagnostic set for suppressed and generated types.",
        "Only guarantee freedom from analyzer exceptions, leaving the remaining diagnostic policy unspecified.",
        "Disable contract diagnostics as well as formatter generation for suppressed types."
      ],
