      "options": [
        "Use the shared guards for both suppressed and non-suppressed types, as implemented.",
        "Condition the new recovery on suppressSourceGeneration being true.",
        "Keep this fix limited to mixed-key failures and handle ordinary generated-type duplicate keys separately."
      ],
