      "statement": "The two new execution tests have no execution result. EVIDENCE marks tests-at-head and tests-without-change for MessagePack.SourceGenerator.ExecutionTests as not_run because the project does not build in the container even at the base commit, initially failing on missing MyGeneratedCompositeResolver.Instance definitions. Thus the new generated-formatter-null assertion and dynamic-resolver round-trip assertion have not been exercised by the supplied runs.",
